  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed70aee8cc8cd4f8ca7ec0b6c7dc5db3, type: 3}
  m_Name: HighlightMaya
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Northbound.Runtime::Northbound.Dialogue.DialogueAsset
  id: highlight_maya
  lines:
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: The room is nearly empty, which is somehow worse and better.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: You looked at it anyway. That counts.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: Maya stands beneath the gallery lights and lets the silence belong to the
      paintings.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: A child points at the shuttered market on one canvas.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: Maya hands Jamie the studio key without claiming she will use it.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: The coordinator leaves the room so the paintings can be looked at without
      an explanation.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: Maya notices the old map in Jamie's bag and smiles without forgiving it.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: Outside, the market sign becomes a dark blue shape in the window.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: She says the studio can be a place to start, not a place to hide.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
